# Archway Angel: "When this creature enters, you gain 2 life for each Gate you control." Bot1 plays a Talon Gates of Madara (a Gate land)
# on turn 1 and a second on turn 3 (no creature is there to target, so each trigger is dropped), then casts the Angel with its Moxes and one Talon's {C}. Bot2 has a Gate of its own and Bot1 has
# no other lands: only Bot1's two Gates count, so Bot1 gains exactly 4 life in one gain (CR 119.3, 608.2c), not 2 or 6. The Angel flies.

